{"text": "INTAKE - FAMILY                file # F-26-0219             taken by: KS (Kiran Sandhu, articled student)\nThurs 8 Oct 2026, 2:10 pm, in person, Surrey office. Interpreter not needed.\n\nCLIENT:  Nguyen-Fraser, Thi Mai   -- goes by \"Mai\"\nDOB 1988-11-03     SIN 683 248 363  (need it for the Form F8)\nAddr: #1204 - 13618 100 Avenue, Surrey BC  V3T 0A8\n   *** DO NOT MAIL ANYTHING HERE. husband opens the mailbox. ***\nSafe phone 604-555-0191 -- TEXT ONLY, never after 9 pm\nEmail mai.nf.safe@inbox.example (new acct, he doesn't know about it)\nClient portal set up today: user mnguyenfraser / temp pw Maple!4471\n\nOTHER SIDE:  Callum Fraser, dob 14 Feb 1985. Foreman at Pattullo Marine Fabricators Ltd.\n(Pattullo Marine), she thinks about 118k plus overtime. No lawyer yet as far as she knows.\n\nMarried 2015-08-22 in Kelowna. Still under one roof. She moved into the spare room\nJuly 1, 2026 -- use that as separation date unless DKG says otherwise.\n\nKIDS:  Owen, 9 (b. 2017-05-19) and Linh, 6. Owen has ADHD, on an IEP at\nBear Creek Elementary. Both kids with her most of the time; callum works 6 days.\n\nWHAT HAPPENED: on the Labour Day weekend he shoved her into the kitchen counter in front of\nOwen. Bruised ribs, went to walk-in next day, has the visit record. RCMP attended;\nfile 2026-118834. No charges \"yet\". She says he has an assault conviction from 2012 in Alberta\n(bar fight). He controls the online banking and changed the password last month.\n\nIMMIGRATION: she is a permanent resident, not a citizen -- he sponsored her in 2014 and tells her he can\n\"send her back\". Told her that is not how it works but DKG to confirm. Parents are in\nHo Chi Minh City. Family is Buddhist; she wants the kids to keep going to temple.\n\nHEALTH: seeing a counsellor for anxiety since June. Also 14 weeks pregnant. He does not know.\n\nMONEY / PROPERTY\n - condo (joint). mortgage w/ Fraser Valley Savings Credit Union, approx $512,000 owing, worth maybe 780k\n - joint chequing at the credit union, acct 100-448-2217\n - her own acct opened last month at Coastline Bank of Canada, ends 9920. About $1,850 in it.\n - his pension (union plan -- he is a member of the Boilermakers local); her RRSP about C$41,000\n - 2022 F-150, his name, BC plate RK4 81T\n - her job: reception at Guildford Family Dental, $24.50/hr, 22 hrs a week\n\nWANTS: protection order (Family Law Act s. 183), kids primarily with her, child support,\nto stay in the condo until the baby comes.\n\nRETAINER: her sister Thi Lan (Thi Lan Nguyen, Burnaby, cell 778 555 0164) will\ne-transfer $3,000 by Friday. Receipt goes to the sister NOT the client.\n\nNEXT: Daljit K. Grewal to call her Tues between 10 and 2. Draft Form F3 for the\nNew Westminster registry. Ask Ms. Nguyen-Fraser to bring walk-in record + photos.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "478 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Kiran Sandhu", "Mai", "Callum Fraser", "Owen", "Linh", "Fraser Valley Savings Credit Union", "Thi Lan Nguyen"], "companies": ["Pattullo Marine Fabricators Ltd", "DKG", "Coastline Bank of Canada", "Guildford Family Dental", "Daljit K. Grewal"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Surrey", "Kelowna", "Pattullo Marine Fabricators Ltd.", "Bear Creek Elementary", "Ho Chi Minh City", "Burnaby", "New Westminster"], "health": ["anxiety", "14 weeks pregnant"], "sensitive": ["Permanent resident", "Buddhist", "ADHD", "assault conviction", "family law", "child support"], "names": ["Thi", "Mai", "Kiran", "Callum", "Owen", "Linh", "Thi Lan", "Daljit"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.20000000298023224, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "